  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6699306e7d4b720b51114246_Screenshot%202024-07-18%20at%2015.32.03.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6699306e7d4b720b51114246_Screenshot%202024-07-18%20at%2015.32.03-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6699306e7d4b720b51114246_Screenshot%202024-07-18%20at%2015.32.03.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6682a0d65f438e4a6e897c13_becchi.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "Becchi on why digital is essential in fast food",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xJYHbPmvXMg\" title=\"5 REASONS TO DIGITALIZE YOUR PIZZERIA | Becchi x Innovorder\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>Becchi, founded by 2 brothers, Baptiste and Matthieu, is a concept specializing in pinsa, a light and easily digestible variant of pizza. With two restaurants in Nation and Madeleine, Becchi strives to bring this unique Italian specialty to as many people as possible. </p>\n          <p>For their second restaurant, located in an office district, Baptiste and Matthieu knew they'd be faced with a fluidity challenge (lots of customers in a short space of time). </p>\n          <h3>2 terminals to speed up order-taking</h3>\n          <p>On the advice of Innovorder expert Adrien, they installed 2 order terminals. Digital ordering has enabled Becchi to streamline the entire process and speed up order-taking. </p>\n          <blockquote> \"This ensures that our customers don't have to wait long, and allows us to serve more customers per minute.\"</blockquote>\n          <p>What's more, the teams free up their time to focus on customer relations, which significantly improves the customer experience. </p>\n          <h3>A toolbox for easy follow-up</h3>\n          <p>With Innovorder, Becchi receives all the metrics from the kiosks and checkout to the back office, simplifying their daily operations and enabling them to easily manage their points of sale. </p>\n          <blockquote>\"We needed a partner who could provide an all-in-one solution, and Innovorder proved to be the right choice. It really is an all-in-one toolbox, so we don't have to go looking for information left and right, everything is centralized.\" </blockquote>\n          <h3>-</h3>\n          <p>Are you a restaurant owner or looking to launch your own restaurant? Call in an Innovorder expert and find out how to easily manage your restaurants and boost your business!</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Becchi",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Independent",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/restaurant-pos-software\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5943581a021e_Backoffice.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Back Office</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
